{"id":"7defeb7e3c558655","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger.md","title":"Omega-consistency Stronger","display":"prop-omega-consistent-stronger — Omega-consistency Stronger","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger","aliases":["90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger"],"display":"prop-omega-consistent-stronger — Omega-consistency Stronger","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega-consistency]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-omega-consistent-stronger — Omega-consistency Stronger"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afba846451d1e711\" href=\"?note=afba846451d1e711\" title=\"90-df-omega-consistency\">90-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afba846451d1e711\" href=\"?note=afba846451d1e711\" title=\"90-df-omega-consistency\">90-df-omega-consistency</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=(0=S0)\">\\(\\bot=(0=S0)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\bot\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\bot\\)</span>；特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> 足够。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的固定演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\land T\\vdash\\neg\\bot]\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\land T\\vdash\\neg\\bot]\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\bot\">\\(T\\vdash\\bot\\)</span>，与假设合用使演算不一致，因而证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists v(v=v)\">\\(\\exists v(v=v)\\)</span>，又对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(\\overline n=\\overline n)\">\\(\\neg(\\overline n=\\overline n)\\)</span>。这违反 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性的定义。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(T\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>没有改变本书专用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 的含义。缺少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg(0=S0)\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg(0=S0)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span> 未必是逻辑矛盾，因此原来无该条件的蕴涵并非对任意算术签名理论都成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"afba846451d1e711","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"afba846451d1e711","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$ 见 [[90-df-omega-consistency]]，$\\bot=(0=S0)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[90-df-consistency-statement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$ 见 [[90-df-omega-consistency]]，$\\bot=(0=S0)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 见 [[90-df-consistency-statement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\vdash\\neg\\bot$；特别地 $\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T$ 足够。$\\vdash$ 是 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的固定演算。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=(0=S0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\neg\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"[\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\land T\\vdash\\neg\\bot]\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists v(v=v)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg(\\overline n=\\overline n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\neg(0=S0)","display":false},{"tex":"0=S0","display":false}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"afba846451d1e711","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"它排除演算上的矛盾；与本书使用 $\\bot=(0=S0)$ 的 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 相联系时，需另有 $T\\vdash\\neg\\bot$，见 [[90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger]]。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a